    "text": "In case of <math> <mrow>  <mtext>AgBr</mtext></mrow></math>, the ionic product will exceed the solubility product before <math> <mrow>  <mtext>AgCl</mtext></mrow></math>, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math>. Thus, <math> <mrow>  <mtext>AgBr</mtext></mrow></math> will start precipitation before other salts.",
